# {{ project_name }}

{{ description }}

A small text ReAct agent that discovers tools over the Model Context Protocol
(MCP). The reasoning loop is plain text, so every Thought, Action, and
Observation is visible in the terminal and in the trace files.

```text
question -> ReActAgent -> LLM ({{ default_model }})
                |
           MCPClient
                |
        JSON-RPC over stdio
                |
           MCP server
{% if include_mcp_server %}
      calculator, current time
{% else %}
      external tools
{% endif %}
```

## Requirements

- Python {{ python_version }}+ and [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/)
{% if llm_provider in ["ollama", "both"] %}
- [Ollama](https://ollama.com/) with a model installed:
  `ollama pull {{ default_model }}`
{% endif %}
{% if llm_provider in ["openai", "both"] %}
