{% endif %}

## Quick start

```bash
uv sync --all-extras
cp .env.example .env
uv run {{ cli_name }} doctor
uv run {{ cli_name }} tools
uv run {{ cli_name }} ask "What is (17 * 3) + 9, and what time is it in UTC?"
```

`ask` prints each Thought, Action, and Observation, then the final answer and
run metrics. Use `--quiet` for just the answer.

{% if not include_mcp_server %}
This project was generated without a bundled MCP server. Point it at an
external server before running `doctor`, `tools`, or `ask`:

```bash
export {{ env_prefix }}SERVER_COMMAND='["uvx", "some-mcp-server"]'
# or use an existing Streamable HTTP endpoint:
export {{ env_prefix }}TRANSPORT=http
export {{ env_prefix }}SERVER_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000/mcp
```
{% endif %}

